WEBVTT

00:06:30.009 --> 00:06:32.896
And it's the idea that we don't have
disposable anything.

00:06:33.205 --> 00:06:35.805
We don't have disposable resources.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:38.931
We don't have disposable species.

00:06:38.955 --> 00:06:41.511
And we don't have
disposable people, either.

00:06:41.535 --> 00:06:43.557
We don't have a throwaway planet,

00:06:43.581 --> 00:06:46.372
and we don't have throwaway
children -- it's all precious.

00:06:46.396 --> 00:06:49.276
And as we all begin to come back
to that basic understanding,

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:52.276
new opportunities for action
begin to emerge.

00:06:52.895 --> 00:06:54.566
Biomimicry,

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:58.107
which is an emerging science,

00:06:58.131 --> 00:07:01.276
winds up being a very important
social justice idea.